# Cert / wave ship handoff (keep it fast)

User workflow (do not invent a slower one):

1. **Writer (this chat)** — one pass: bank expand once → apkg once → Gumroad create/assets → SEO/GEO wire → focused tests → gate script → **STOP**
2. **Bank content review (mandatory)** — fix-first subagent. Default **`gpt-5.6-sol-medium`** (cheaper). Escalate **`claude-opus-5-thinking-high`** on P0 remap/contamination, first live start on never-ledgered SKU, or user asks Opus. Never Grok. See `mock-bank-review-model.mdc`. No second full bank rewrite unless content P0.
3. **Sample screenshots (agent renders, not the user)** — `npm run refresh:sold-samples -- --slug {deckSlug}` → `npm run render:sample-shots -- --slug {deckSlug}` (review PNGs) → `--write --publish` puts `public/samples/{deckSlug}-sample-{1,2,3}.webp` + matching `decks.ts` sampleCards, then runs the Gumroad publisher for the deck type (wave `--polish-only`, building landings, finance polish, authored landing) + `check:gumroad-sample-cdn`, so Gumroad gets gallery **and** custom landing **Sample cards body** (not cover-only / site-only). Publisher table: `mock-bank-audit-standard.mdc` §5
4. **Publish** — commit/push only after user OK; `llms:export` already done in step 1

## Path picker

| SKU type | Spec / catalog | Apkg | Gumroad | Gate |
|----------|----------------|------|---------|------|
| Building cert | `building-deck-specs` + `certifications/registry` | `building_deck_pipeline` | `setup:gumroad-building-decks` | `npm run validate:certification -- --deck {slug}` |
| Wave / niche | `wave-deck-specs` + `wave-anki-decks.json` | `wave_deck_pipeline` | `setup:gumroad-wave-decks` | `npm run validate:wave-deck -- --slug {slug}` |

ACE CPT, Luxembourg Vivre ensemble, and most health/CDL SKUs are **wave**, not building registry.

## Classic Gumroad page first (user, 2026-10-02)

Buyers find us through Gumroad Discover search, which shows the **classic product page**. Do **not** build new custom landings (`products page publish`). Selling power goes into: title + tags/category (Discover ranking), `custom_summary`, rich HTML description from `src/data/gumroad/landing-copy.json` (validator: `scripts/landing-copy-validate.py`), and 3 real sample screenshots in the `--preview-image` gallery. Existing custom landings stay until the user decides to clear them (`gumroad products page clear`). The landing steps below are legacy.

## Gumroad product (always — hard gate)

Every published Anki SKU must have on Gumroad:
1. **Rich HTML description** (exam context, what's inside, FAQ, disclaimer, site/mock links)
2. **3 sample screenshots in the product body** via custom landing Sample cards (`publish-wave-gumroad-landings.py` / building equivalent) — Gumroad strips `<img>` from default description
3. Gallery previews via `--preview-image` (wave polish also uploads these)

**Phase C is incomplete until polish-only succeeds** (description + gallery + landing body). Site webps alone are not enough.

Wave:
```bash
# after render:sample-shots --write produced public/samples/{slug}-sample-{1,2,3}.webp
npm run setup:gumroad-wave-decks -- --slug {slug} --polish-only
# (calls publish-wave-gumroad-landings.py for Sample cards in product body)
```
Building: `polish-building-gumroad.py` + `publish-building-gumroad-landings.py`.

Do not leave a live Gumroad product with thin one-paragraph copy and cover-only images.

## Gumroad sample CDN (403 guard)

After `--polish-only`, cover cleanup, or any Gumroad asset change, run:

```bash
npm run check:gumroad-sample-cdn
```

If broken: re-publish landings with `--force-cdn` on the matching script (`publish-building-gumroad-landings.py`, `publish-wave-gumroad-landings.py`, `publish-language-gumroad-landings.py`). Exit code 1 = at least one `public-files.gumroad.com` sample URL is stale (usually HTTP 403).

## Speed rules

- Do **not** mix unrelated audits (Danish, PTCB, planned P0, …) into the active ship
- Expand bank **once**; regenerate apkg/assets only after a real content fix from review
- Do **not** invent blank/identical sample webps or mock up card text — samples come only from `render:sample-shots` on the shipped `.apkg`
- GEO in the same writer pass: exam-facts + commercial cite / one-liner + money-page + `npm run llms:export`
- After writer gate is READY (0 fails), hand to review immediately — do not keep polishing for hours
